check 1
# Level generation of the Flayer Dungeon Level 1 (level 88): ScnAm3 starts in
# Kurast Docks (act 3 open), -seed 1234, idle until frame 20, then the level
# warp (poke `warp 88`, tile 0) on both sides. Compare the dungeon's rooms,
# presets and populated units, and the draws (record_rng.py with the
# poke). Area C (level generation). Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name a3-warp-flayer-dungeon-ama
save ScnAm3 --class ama --expansion --act 2 --quests acts=2
seed 1234
ticks 160
seconds 900
channels state rng
at 20 poke warp 88
